---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我 - Rito-492">
	<section class="about-section">
		<div class="about-header">
			<div class="avatar-container">
				<div class="avatar">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<circle cx="12" cy="8" r="5"/>
						<path d="M20 21a8 8 0 1 0-16 0"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
			<h1>关于我</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">了解更多关于我的信息</p>
		</div>

		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="intro">
				<h2><span class="icon">👋</span> 简介</h2>
				<p>
					你好！我是 Rito-492，一名热爱编程的开发者。我喜欢探索新技术，
					解决有趣的问题，并通过代码创造价值。
				</p>
				<p>
					目前专注于人体运动预测、概率建模和深度学习研究。
					我相信技术可以改变世界，而我希望成为其中的一份子。
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="skills-section">
				<h2><span class="icon">💻</span> 技术技能</h2>
				<div class="skill-category">
					<h3>编程语言</h3>
					<div class="skill-tags">
						<span class="skill-tag">JavaScript/TypeScript</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Go</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">C++</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="skill-category">
					<h3>前端技术</h3>
					<div class="skill-tags">
						<span class="skill-tag">React</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Vue</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Astro</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Tailwind CSS</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Next.js</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="skill-category">
					<h3>后端技术</h3>
					<div class="skill-tags">
						<span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Express</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">FastAPI</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">MySQL</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">MongoDB</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="skill-category">
					<h3>工具 & 其他</h3>
					<div class="skill-tags">
						<span class="skill-tag">Git</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Docker</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">Linux</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">CI/CD</span>
						<span class="skill-tag">PyTorch</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="contact-section">
				<h2><span class="icon">📬</span> 联系方式</h2>
				<p>
					如果你有任何问题、合作想法或只是想聊聊技术，欢迎通过以下方式联系我：
				</p>
				<div class="social-links">
					<a href="https://github.com/Rito-492" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn github">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
							<path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
						</svg>
						<span>GitHub</span>
					</a>
					<a href="mailto:your-email@example.com" class="social-btn email">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
							<rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/>
							<path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
						</svg>
						<span>Email</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="cta-section">
				<p>想看看我的项目和作品？</p>
				<a href="/" class="btn primary">回到主页</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-section {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.about-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.avatar-container {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.avatar {
		width: 120px;
		height: 120px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-hover) 100%);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: white;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.3);
	}

	.about-section h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.intro, .skills-section, .contact-section {
		background: var(--color-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--color-shadow);
		transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
	}

	.intro:hover, .skills-section:hover, .contact-section:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.15);
	}

	.intro h2, .skills-section h2, .contact-section h2 {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.3rem;
	}

	.intro h2 .icon, .skills-section h2 .icon, .contact-section h2 .icon {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	.intro p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.skill-category {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.skill-category:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.skill-category h3 {
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.skill-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.skill-tag {
		background: rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.1);
		color: var(--color-primary);
		padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: all 0.2s;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
	}

	.skill-tag:hover {
		background: rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.2);
		border-color: var(--color-primary);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.contact-section p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.social-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.social-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		background: var(--color-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: all 0.2s;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 4px var(--color-shadow);
	}

	.social-btn:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-primary);
		color: var(--color-primary);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.15);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.cta-section {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.05), rgba(14, 116, 144, 0.1));
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.1);
	}

	.cta-section p {
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.3s;
	}

	.btn.primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-hover) 100%);
		color: #ffffff;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.3);
	}

	.btn.primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.4);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.about-section {
			padding: 2rem 1rem;
		}

		.about-section h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.social-links {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.social-btn {
			justify-content: center;
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
